        <div class="tour-content">
          <h3>Desert Experiences</h3>
          <p>Make your trip special with outdoor adventures and memorable local experiences.</p>
          <a href="#contact">Ask About This Tour →</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Why Travel With Us?</h2>
      <p>Personal service and experiences designed around you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <span>🏛️</span>
        <h3>Local Knowledge</h3>
        <p>Discover Egypt's history and stories with a knowledgeable local guide.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span>🚗</span>
        <h3>Private Experiences</h3>
        <p>Explore at your own pace with itineraries tailored to your interests.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span>🤝</span>
        <h3>Personal Service</h3>
        <p>Get help planning your trip and choosing the right experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span>🌍</span>
        <h3>Authentic Egypt</h3>
        <p>Go beyond the landmarks and discover local culture and everyday life.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Ready to Explore Egypt?</h2>
    <p>Tell us what you would love to discover, and let's plan your journey.</p>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:letspyramidtours@gmail.com?subject=Let's%20Local%20Egypt%20Tour%20Inquiry">Contact Us by Email</a>
    <p>Private tours • Local experiences • Unforgettable memories</p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 Let's Local Egypt. Explore Egypt by Local Eyes.</p>
